# Play test of The Ice Organ (CIPlay ice_organ, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the beach at -6 0.8
# (the bay zone at -14 1); the hut on the east ridge's slope (pad 3 m, deck 4.2 m, ladder at 11 10.4); the ramp from
# the beach up to the organ cave's mouth at -15 -3, its floor about 2.5 m; the pipes along its west side (x -19.6); the
# score on the east wall; the crypt gate across the cave at z -23, the crypt behind it (floor 2.4 m)
island The Ice Organ
expect step 0
expect title The Frozen Score
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 5

# The bay; up to Halvard's hut: his letter, the mallet in his chest; the woodpile and snowmobile boxes
walk -3 2 to -6 0.8 h=0.4
zone bay
expect step 1
walk 11 7.8 to 11 9.2 h=3
climb 11 10.4 h=3
expect stand 11 12.5 h=4.2 below=6
read Halvard's letter
expect step 2
open Organist's chest
expect story mallet 1
expect step 3
open Woodpile box
open Snowmobile box
expect step 4

# The organ cave: the score, the cache behind the snow bank; a wrong pipe first; then the five in the score's order - the key
walk -6 0.6 to -12.5 -2.5 to -15 -5 to -15 -9 h=2.5
zone organcave
expect step 5
walk -15 -10 to -15 -14 h=2.5 below=5
read The frozen score
expect step 6
open Cave cache
expect step 7
use cryptgate
expect message frozen over
use pipegreat
expect message sour clang
use pipethin
use pipecracked
use pipegreat
use pipebent
use pipeblue
expect story icekey 1
expect step 8

# The crypt: the gate sinks; in - the bear wakes; the last page, the coffer
use cryptgate
wait 4
walk -14 -20 to -14 -24 to -14 -26.5 h=2.5 below=5
zone crypt
expect step 9
kill Polar bear
expect step 10
read Halvard's last page
expect step 11
open Halvard's coffer
expect done
